{
 "voice": "af_heart",
 "speed": 1.1,
 "duration": 159.878,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "This is everything in Fortnitemares right now, straight from Epic's own news and the official map.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 5.265
  },
  {
   "text": "Bosses, a cursed cartridge, a quest you can only unlock with friends, and exactly where to find all of it.",
   "t0": 5.515,
   "t1": 11.346
  },
  {
   "text": "Let's get into it.",
   "t0": 11.596,
   "t1": 12.587
  },
  {
   "text": "First, the big one. Epic's news tile is called The Horror Is Here.",
   "t0": 12.987,
   "t1": 16.407
  },
  {
   "text": "A cursed cartridge is spreading through the Island, corrupting everything it touches.",
   "t0": 16.657,
   "t1": 20.723
  },
  {
   "text": "Step into Battle Royale to see what hair-raising horrors await,",
   "t0": 20.923,
   "t1": 24.088
  },
  {
   "text": "including powerful new weapons, terrifying mechanics, horrifying bosses, and more.",
   "t0": 24.138,
   "t1": 28.886
  },
  {
   "text": "And that cartridge isn't just a story beat. There's a named spot on the map called the Dark Cartridge.",
   "t0": 29.236,
   "t1": 34.416
  },
  {
   "text": "It sits right here, close to the middle of the island.",
   "t0": 34.616,
   "t1": 37.073
  },
  {
   "text": "If you want to see the corruption for yourself, this is where to drop.",
   "t0": 37.273,
   "t1": 40.606
  },
  {
   "text": "Next, Five Nights at Freddy's.",
   "t0": 41.006,
   "t1": 42.593
  },
  {
   "text": "It's showtime! Face down animatronic bosses in Battle Royale,",
   "t0": 42.793,
   "t1": 46.387
  },
  {
   "text": "with one always lurking at Freddy Fazbear's Pizza Parlor.",
   "t0": 46.437,
   "t1": 49.398
  },
  {
   "text": "Defeat any rogue robot you find to possess the suit and finish the fight Fazbear style.",
   "t0": 49.598,
   "t1": 54.247
  },
  {
   "text": "So where is it? Freddy Fazbear's Pizzeria is a named spot on the map,",
   "t0": 54.597,
   "t1": 58.456
  },
  {
   "text": "right here, in the northern part of the island.",
   "t0": 58.506,
   "t1": 60.651
  },
  {
   "text": "That's the one place you know an animatronic boss will be.",
   "t0": 60.851,
   "t1": 63.695
  },
  {
   "text": "And if you want to look the part, the Five Nights at Freddy's Bundle was in the Item Shop on October 28th:",
   "t0": 64.095,
   "t1": 69.725
  },
  {
   "text": "Freddy Fazbear, Foxy the Pirate, Chica the Chicken and Bonnie the Rabbit,",
   "t0": 69.875,
   "t1": 73.782
  },
  {
   "text": "for 4,500 V-Bucks, listed at 11,000.",
   "t0": 73.882,
   "t1": 77.555
  },
  {
   "text": "Quick one: if you buy anything in the shop, use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel, and it keeps these videos coming.",
   "t0": 77.955,
   "t1": 85.38
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, the community side of Fortnitemares. Epic's tile is called Horrors Worth Facing Together.",
   "t0": 85.83,
   "t1": 91.028
  },
  {
   "text": "Wickedly talented Developers have brought their own horrors to life for Fortnitemares!",
   "t0": 91.278,
   "t1": 95.746
  },
  {
   "text": "Explore a Collection of spine-chilling Islands, each with its own twist.",
   "t0": 95.896,
   "t1": 99.569
  },
  {
   "text": "Face the fear with friends to unlock the Safety in Numbers Quest.",
   "t0": 99.719,
   "t1": 103.115
  },
  {
   "text": "So that's a quest you can't do solo. Grab your squad before you jump into the Collection.",
   "t0": 103.365,
   "t1": 107.928
  },
  {
   "text": "One more spot that fits the season: Nightmare Neighborhood is a named location on the map,",
   "t0": 108.328,
   "t1": 113.373
  },
  {
   "text": "right here, north-west of the island's centre.",
   "t0": 113.423,
   "t1": 115.664
  },
  {
   "text": "And all of this is happening on top of Override.",
   "t0": 116.064,
   "t1": 118.494
  },
  {
   "text": "There are all new Sprites to discover and collect!",
   "t0": 118.694,
   "t1": 120.86
  },
  {
   "text": "Extract and equip them for game-changing Sprite Powers, level them up, and keep growing the Collection in Override.",
   "t0": 121.01,
   "t1": 127.354
  },
  {
   "text": "Sprites will now appear in Ranked too, with abilities disabled to maintain even competition.",
   "t0": 127.504,
   "t1": 132.731
  },
  {
   "text": "And if you're hunting Override Consoles, there are seven of them on the map right now.",
   "t0": 133.081,
   "t1": 137.188
  },
  {
   "text": "So, the quick recap.",
   "t0": 137.588,
   "t1": 138.749
  },
  {
   "text": "The cursed cartridge is spreading, and the Dark Cartridge sits near the middle of the map.",
   "t0": 138.949,
   "t1": 143.179
  },
  {
   "text": "One animatronic boss is always at Freddy Fazbear's, up north.",
   "t0": 143.329,
   "t1": 146.867
  },
  {
   "text": "Safety in Numbers needs friends.",
   "t0": 147.017,
   "t1": 148.626
  },
  {
   "text": "And Sprites are in Ranked, with their abilities turned off.",
   "t0": 148.776,
   "t1": 151.527
  },
  {
   "text": "Which part of Fortnitemares are you playing first? Tell me in the comments.",
   "t0": 151.877,
   "t1": 155.265
  },
  {
   "text": "And if this helped, use code BAD in the Item Shop. See you in the next one.",
   "t0": 155.515,
   "t1": 159.478
  }
 ],
